WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.450
- So...uh....let's begin,

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.890
at the beginning,

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:08.850
with the probability,

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.580
both philosophically and mathematically.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.780
What does it mean to say the probability

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.380
of something happening is 50 percent?

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.430
What is probability?

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.910
- It's a degree of uncertainty,

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.640
that an agent has about the world.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.240
- [Interviewer] You're still
expressing some knowledge

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.073
in that statement.

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:30.170
- [Guest] Of course, if the
probability is 90 percent,

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.532
it's absolutely different
kind of knowledge

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.732
than if it's 10 percent.

00:00:35.028 --> 00:00:38.480
- But it's still not
solid knowledge, it's....

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.750
- [Guest] It is solid
knowledge, (mumbles).

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:45.080
If you tell me that 90 percent (mumbles)

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.256
smoking will give you
lung cancer in five years,

00:00:49.256 --> 00:00:54.256
versus 10 percent, it's a
piece of useful knowledge.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.370
- So, the statistical
view of the universe,

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.860
why is it useful?

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.990
So we're swimming in complete uncertainty,

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:04.220
most of everything around us.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.760
- Yes, it allows you to
predict things with certain

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:10.056
probability, and computing
those probabilities

00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:11.600
are very useful.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.113
That's the whole idea of.......

00:01:15.266 --> 00:01:16.393
prediction,

00:01:17.616 --> 00:01:20.430
[Guest] and you need prediction
to be able to survive.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.444
If you can't predict the future, then just

00:01:22.444 --> 00:01:26.024
crossing the street
would be extremely.....

00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:27.093
fearful.

